      "message": "IIUC this is not always true since we might get transport TEST+CELLULAR where the type is mobile according to the NetworkCapabilitiesUtils#getDisplayTransport.\nOtherwise we\u0027ll need to maintain another mapping table, which is also not great.\n\nRefer to:\nhttps://osscs.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/libs/net/common/framework/com/android/net/module/util/NetworkCapabilitiesUtils.java;l\u003d133?ss\u003dandroid\u0026q\u003dgetDisplayTransport\u0026start\u003d1",
