      "message": "Agree with Junyu.\n\nGenerally, there can be multiple transports. We could use NetworkCapabilitiesUtils#getDisplayTransport to collapse into one, but I think specifying explicitly is better for tests.\n\n(you may want to call the first argument \"transports\", or make it a [] with a helper that only takes an int or something though ; if you have a helper that takes an int, then Aaron\u0027s suggestion makes a lot of sense for that helper)",
